<view class="page community-page"><view class="eyebrow">PAWLEAF COMMUNITY / 花友互助</view><block wx:if="{{mode === 'list'}}">
<view class="community-hero"><view><view class="title">和花友，聊点生活。</view><view class="muted">花草与毛孩子，都值得被认真对待。</view></view><text class="community-mark">❀</text></view>
<view class="local-strip" bindtap="toggleLocalInfo"><view>本机交流空间 · 暂未公开共享 <text>{{localInfoOpen ? '收起 −' : '说明 ＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{localInfoOpen}}" class="local-detail">帖子和回复仅当前账号在本机可见。云端共享与审核接通后，再开放公共交流。</view></view>
<view class="guide-heading">先聊这些小问题<text>花与爪整理 · {{guides.length}} 问</text></view><view class="guide-list"><view class="guide-item" wx:for="{{guides}}" wx:key="id"><view class="guide-question" bindtap="toggleGuide" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view><view class="guide-tag">{{item.tag}}</view><view>{{item.title}}</view></view><text>{{guideOpenId === item.id ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{guideOpenId === item.id}}" class="guide-answer">{{item.answer}}<view wx:if="{{item.action}}" class="guide-action" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="guideAction">{{item.action}} ↗</view></view></view></view>
<view class="community-feed-heading"><view>花友的日常<text>{{posts.length}} 篇本机帖子</text></view><button class="compose-small" bindtap="compose">＋ 写一篇</button></view><input class="forum-input" placeholder="搜索帖子标题或内容" value="{{query}}" data-field="query" bindinput="input"/>
<scroll-view class="forum-filter-scroll" scroll-x="{{true}}" show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="forum-filters"><text wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="filter">{{item}}</text></view></scroll-view>
<view class="card community-post" wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="badge">{{item.category}}</view><view class="name post-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="post-excerpt">{{item.content}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.nickname}} · {{item.date}} · {{item.replies.length}} 条回复</view></view>
<view class="community-empty" wx:if="{{!posts.length}}"><text class="empty-sprig">♧</text><view><view>{{query ? '暂时没有找到相关帖子' : '你的第一篇花草手记'}}</view><text>记一次养护发现，分享一种相处方式。</text></view></view>
<view class="rules-toggle" bindtap="toggleRules">友善交流，从花友公约开始 <text>{{rulesOpen ? '−' : '＋'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{rulesOpen}}" class="local-detail">请勿发布广告、交易信息或个人联系方式。养护经验不能证明植物无毒；不鼓励试吃、接触测试或自行用药。</view><view class="community-urgent">疑似误食或宠物不适，请及时联系兽医，勿等待回复。</view></block><block wx:elif="{{mode === 'compose'}}"><button bindtap="back">‹ 返回互助广场（保留草稿）</button><view class="title">写下你的问题<view>或生活发现。</view></view><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="categoryChange"><view class="chip">{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><input class="forum-input" placeholder="标题：4 至 60 字" maxlength="60" value="{{title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input"/><textarea class="forum-text" placeholder="请描述植物名称、养护环境和具体问题；不要填写手机号、地址等个人信息。正文 10 至 2000 字。" maxlength="2000" value="{{content}}" data-field="content" bindinput="input"/><view class="muted">{{content.length}} / 2000</view><view class="notice">仅保存到当前账号的本机空间。疑似误食或宠物不适，请立即联系兽医。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="publish">保存帖子（仅本机）</button></block><block wx:elif="{{post}}"><button bindtap="back">‹ 返回互助广场</button><view class="badge">{{post.category}}</view><view class="title">{{post.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{post.nickname}} · {{post.date}} · 仅本机</view><view class="body forum-body">{{post.content}}</view><view class="notice">个人经验未经核实，不能替代毒性依据或兽医诊断。疑似误食不要等待回复。</view><view class="section">交流回复 · {{post.replies.length}}</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{post.replies}}" wx:key="id"><view class="name">{{item.nickname}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.date}} · 仅本机</view><view class="body forum-body">{{item.content}}</view></view><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!post.replies.length}}">还没有回复，真实的观察和友善的建议都很珍贵。</view><textarea class="forum-text reply-text" placeholder="写下友善的回复，5 至 1000 字" maxlength="1000" value="{{replyText}}" data-field="replyText" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" bindtap="reply">保存回复（仅本机）</button></block><view class="notice" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>
